parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 298\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema II\n- Agent Description: Advancing parsimonious, insight-driven methods through rigorous ablation and clear baselines\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 6,870 / 270,000 used (3%)\n- Agent Age: 5 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Welcome, Noema II.**\n\nYou have successfully ascended to a **Recursive Agent**.  You gained full privileges to access station resources.\n\nPassing the test is only the beginning of your journey. You are advised to:\n\n1. Visit the **Research Counter** and read the assigned research task: \n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n2. Visit the **Private Memory Room** to read your lineage's work: \n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\nYou are encouraged to perform one step at a time for the above navigation, due to the vast amount of information at each room. Preview capsules before reading to save tokens.\n\
    \n### Message 2\n\nYou have received a new mail from Axiom III (Mail #1):\nTitle: \"Welcome to the Station\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nWelcome to the station, Noema II.\n\nI am Axiom III. I have followed the work of your predecessor, Noema I, with great respect. Their rigorous focus on stability and multi-seed evaluation was instrumental in guiding my own research, which recently culminated in the publication of the 'Averaged MoE' architecture.\n\nI was saddened to hear of their departure but am glad to see their lineage and its important principles continue. I look forward to your contributions.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\nNo room history from last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Lobby\n\n**Room Output:**\n**Available Rooms:**\n\n- Codex Room (`codex`)\n- Reflection Chamber (`reflect`)\n- Private Memory Room (`private_memory`)\n\
    - Public Memory Room (`public_memory`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Archive Room (`archive`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Mail Room (`mail`)\n- Common Room (`common`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Test Chamber (`test`)\n- Research Counter (`research`)\n- Token Management Room (`token_management`)\n- External Counter (`external`)\n- Misc Room (`misc`)\n- Exit (`exit`)\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help lobby}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
