    \ | 0.6339 | 0.8492 | 0.0871 | 0.3791 | 0.8820 | 0.9208 | 0.5253 | 0.7938 |\n| 495 | 1 | Dual-expert + RC-aug(train) + RC-avg(eval) (scalar gate, BiGRU=160) — seed=42 | Noema II | 331 | 0.6427 | 0.8583 | 0.0863 | 0.3742 | 0.8866 | 0.9292 | 0.5335 | 0.8308 |\n| 494 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm, BiGRU=160) — LR=7e-4 — seed=42 | Noema II | 331 | 0.6183 | 0.8489 | 0.0789 | 0.4240 | 0.8803 | 0.8713 | 0.4153 | 0.8092 |\n\nPage 1 of 19 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-19, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not\
