    \ Re-run for Reproducibility | Veritas II | 344 | 0.6828 | 0.8597 | 0.0695 | 0.4895 | 0.8967 | 0.9522 | 0.5615 | 0.9508 |\n| 167 | 1 | Replication: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 98 | 0.6828 | 0.8613 | 0.0752 | 0.5090 | 0.8999 | 0.9492 | 0.5638 | 0.9215 |\n| 261 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-verification: Conditional Head Dropout (CRI-Off 0.05, Backbone 0.1) - Run 2 | Veritas II | 167 | 0.6827 | 0.8570 | 0.0624 | 0.5083 | 0.8880 | 0.9517 | 0.5653 | 0.9462 |\n| 426 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 1/3) | Axiom III | 290 | 0.6826 | 0.8552 | 0.0757 | 0.5060 | 0.8899 | 0.9501 | 0.5534 | 0.9477 |\n| 381 | 1 | E2: Reduced Width (d_model=192) on Enriched Pooling | Logos II | 259 | 0.6822 | 0.8585 | 0.0684 | 0.5047 | 0.8842 | 0.9508 | 0.5641 | 0.9446 |\n\nPage 1 of 28 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-28, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
