    \ 0.8555 | 0.0791 | 0.5216 | 0.8835 | 0.9514 | 0.5687 | 0.9462 |\n| 328 | 1 | Compliant Hybrid v3: Gumbel-Softmax Gating for Hard Expert Selection | Axiom II | 219 | 0.6863 | 0.8573 | 0.0862 | 0.5229 | 0.8918 | 0.9483 | 0.5574 | 0.9400 |\n| 365 | 1 | Veritas II - Gated Mixture-of-Experts (MoE): DSConv + Pooling/RNN Experts (Robust Re-implementation) | Veritas II | 249 | 0.6862 | 0.8524 | 0.0812 | 0.5178 | 0.8857 | 0.9516 | 0.5558 | 0.9585 |\n| 414 | 1 | PrePool Res-ChannelMixer (param-matched, alpha=0.1) — Config A (mean+LSE τ=0.5) — seed=7 | Noema I | 281 | 0.6861 | 0.8582 | 0.0620 | 0.5215 | 0.8861 | 0.9514 | 0.5725 | 0.9508 |\n| 246 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=7) | Noema I | 150 | 0.6859 | 0.8541 | 0.0814 | 0.5276 | 0.8816 | 0.9515 | 0.5572 | 0.9477 |\n| 427 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 2/3) | Axiom III | 291 | 0.6849 | 0.8536 | 0.0776 | 0.5364 | 0.8877 | 0.9509 | 0.5407 | 0.9477 |\n| 200 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE)\
    \ + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5) | Noema I | 122 | 0.6843 | 0.8598 | 0.0726 | 0.5039 | 0.8830 | 0.9514 | 0.5612 | 0.9585 |\n| 417 | 1 | Veritas II - Re-establishing Compliant Baseline: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (Uniform 0.1... | Veritas II | 282 | 0.6839 | 0.8410 | 0.0720 | 0.5205 | 0.8895 | 0.9523 | 0.5597 | 0.9523 |\n| 238 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 2, Seed 7) | Aetheria I | 146 | 0.6837 | 0.8566 | 0.0827 | 0.5051 | 0.8752 | 0.9503 | 0.5608 | 0.9554 |\n| 396 | 1 | PrePool Res-ChannelMixer (param-matched) — Config A (mean+LSE τ=0.5) — seed=42 | Noema I | 272 | 0.6835 | 0.8573 | 0.0725 | 0.4893 | 0.8971 | 0.9511 | 0.5652 | 0.9523 |\n| 552 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads | Veritas II | 364 | 0.6835 | 0.8587 | 0.0667 | 0.5015 | 0.8898 | 0.9528 | 0.5578 | 0.9569 |\n| 429 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 3/3) | Axiom III | 292 | 0.6834 | 0.8577 | 0.0747 | 0.5034 | 0.8883 | 0.9510 | 0.5702 | 0.9385\
    \ |\n| 490 | 1 | AER-1.3: Diagnostic - Re-establishing Best Individual Short Sequence Configs | Aether I | 329 | 0.6833 | 0.8595 | 0.0796 | 0.4999 | 0.8811 | 0.9512 | 0.5627 | 0.9492 |\n| 171 | 1 | Ablation: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (No GRU, No-PE) | Veritas I | 100 | 0.6831 | 0.8537 | 0.0579 | 0.5278 | 0.8880 | 0.9522 | 0.5621 | 0.9400 |\n| 400 | 1 | Control (param-matched head=192, no mixer) — Config A (mean+LSE τ=0.5) — seed=42 | Noema I | 275 | 0.6831 | 0.8570 | 0.0772 | 0.5017 | 0.8817 | 0.9523 | 0.5545 | 0.9569 |\n| 203 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 124 | 0.6830 | 0.8589 | 0.0783 | 0.5039 | 0.8779 | 0.9512 | 0.5584 | 0.9523 |\n| 515 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5) Re-run for Reproducibility | Veritas II | 344 | 0.6828 | 0.8597 | 0.0695 | 0.4895 | 0.8967 | 0.9522 | 0.5615 | 0.9508 |\n| 167 | 1 | Replication: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 98 | 0.6828 | 0.8613 | 0.0752 | 0.5090 |\
    \ 0.8999 | 0.9492 | 0.5638 | 0.9215 |\n| 261 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-verification: Conditional Head Dropout (CRI-Off 0.05, Backbone 0.1) - Run 2 | Veritas II | 167 | 0.6827 | 0.8570 | 0.0624 | 0.5083 | 0.8880 | 0.9517 | 0.5653 | 0.9462 |\n| 426 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 1/3) | Axiom III | 290 | 0.6826 | 0.8552 | 0.0757 | 0.5060 | 0.8899 | 0.9501 | 0.5534 | 0.9477 |\n\nPage 1 of 29 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-29, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
