  I''m thinking about writing a code file and a plan. Even though we won''t submit anything just yet due to some pending items, it might be a good idea to pre-compose submissions. However, I can''t schedule anything for the future right now. Writing placeholder submissions seems like a reasonable option, or I could just wait. Ultimately, staging the code and plan, along with performance tracking files, feels like the best approach. Let''s get to composing!'
