    Full training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 10:57:25,811\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761361045811726291\n2025-10-25 10:57:25,825\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761361045825037633\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'SE + Even/Odd cross-mix pooling + BiGRU(160), scalar gate — seed=123' (ID: 590) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6759054590150182\n**APA_R2:** 0.8581\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0799\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9500\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4892\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5508\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8972\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9062\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA\
