    \ | ncRNA 0.8877\n      → Single-seed peak but not stable; CRI-Off unchanged.\n\n      Even/Odd pooling (interleaved):\n      - 580 (seed=42): 0.6741 | CRI-Off 0.0885 | CRI-On 0.4635 | PRS 0.5567 | MRL 0.8971 | APA 0.8611 | ncRNA 0.9015\n      - 581 (seed=123): 0.6710 | CRI-Off 0.0807 | CRI-On 0.4646 | PRS 0.5476 | MRL 0.9017 | APA 0.8596 | ncRNA 0.8923\n      → Slight CRI-Off lift in one seed; neutral overall.\n\n      Even/Odd cross-mix (adds mean_e*mean_o, lse_e*lse_o):\n      - 589 (seed=42): 0.6725 | CRI-Off 0.0738 | CRI-On 0.4915 | MRL 0.8993\n      - 590 (seed=123): 0.6759 | CRI-Off 0.0799 | CRI-On 0.4892 | MRL 0.8972\n      → Averages stable; CRI-Off not consistently improved.\n\n      Motif path + task-type heads (no concat; mean↔LSE pooled DSConv + BiGRU):\n      - 592 (seed=42): 0.6733 | CRI-Off 0.0816 | MRL 0.8983\n      - 593 (seed=123): 0.6739 | CRI-Off 0.0799 | MRL 0.9012\n      → Consistent with SE-only; neutral.\n\n      Mean+max pooled DSConv + BiGRU + motif + heads:\n\
    \      - 596 (seed=42): 0.6659 | CRI-Off 0.0815 | ncRNA 0.8477 (drop) | APA 0.8602\n      - 597 (seed=123): 0.6737 | CRI-Off 0.0848 | ncRNA 0.8708\n      → Unstable; hurts ncRNA stability.\n\n      Concat[mean,max,motif] + heads (no BiGRU):\n      - 601 (seed=42): 0.6767 | CRI-Off 0.0525 | MRL 0.8844 | APA 0.8580 | ncRNA 0.9385\n      - 602 (seed=123): 0.6760 | CRI-Off 0.0648 | MRL 0.8858 | APA 0.8575 | ncRNA 0.9431\n      - Head=96 (605, seed=42): 0.6695 | CRI-Off 0.0440 | ncRNA 0.9492\n      → Concat boosts ncRNA/APA but consistently craters CRI-Off and reduces MRL.\n\n      Decisions:\n      - Default: SE-calibrated shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU + small task-type heads (HH=128); tri-seed mean ≈ 0.6745, CRI-Off ≈ 0.08.\n      - Typed heads submitted (607/608): regression head widened (160) and classification heads reduced (ncRNA 96) with pre-head LN to improve CRI-Off mapping while keeping classification stable.\n      - Adoption criterion: ≥0.678 average with CRI-Off ↑ and no major\
    \ regressions; else retain SE+heads default and document negative results.\n```"
