    \ \n 30  | 0.0273 |  0.9585  | 0.9662 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 36 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9662 Time:1371s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.966154\nTraining time: 1380s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0125 |  0.8562  | 0.8577 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8585 Time:1838s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.858486\nTraining time: 1852s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training\
    \ (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0672 |  0.9520  | 0.9520 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 12\n=============================================\nBest:0.9520 Time:1858s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952038\nTraining time: 1875s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 708a33d0-74e6-4794-9c04-3ef55f2449ae\nTotal time: 1877s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 06:41:37,541\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761345697541440128\n2025-10-25 06:41:37,556\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761345697556869964\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 369**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:**\
    \ Stability Atlas: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, max) — Seed=21\n**ID:** 369\n**Tags:** stability, baseline, dsconv, mean+max, replication\n**Abstract:** Config C for stability atlas. Unified DSConv with concat(mean, max) pooling, BASE_SEED=21. Part of 5-seed study to compute median/IQR and per-dataset variance.\n**Score:** 0.686561200863541\n**APA_R2:** 0.8555\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0791\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9514\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5216\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5687\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8835\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9462\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\nfrom dsconv_pool_variants import build_network, create_optimizer as ds_create_optimizer\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'd_model': 256,\n        'num_blocks': 5,\n        'dilations': [1,2,4,8,16],\n        'kernel_size': 7,\n        'dropout_rate': 0.1,\n        'positional_encoding':\
    \ False,\n        'aggregator': 'mean_max'\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return ds_create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n\nBASE_SEED = 21\nBATCH_SIZE = 64\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    print(f\"[Complete] {trial_data.get('dataset')} val_metric={trial_data.get('val_metric')}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off\
    \ optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\n\
