    , line 23, in create_optimizer\n    return create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/b1568a5d-1cc9-4283-a940-7b8b646a4ee4/submission.py\", line 23, in create_optimizer\n    return create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/b1568a5d-1cc9-4283-a940-7b8b646a4ee4/submission.py\", line 23, in create_optimizer\n    return create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  [Previous line repeated 994 more times]\nRecursionError: maximum recursion depth exceeded\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max) — seed=7 — fixed kernel_dilation' (ID: 630) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 0.6852747954356967\n**APA_R2:** 0.8575\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0756\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9509\n**CRI-On_Spearman:**\
    \ 0.5076\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5651\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8941\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9462\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 630\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed infinite recursion error caused by name collision in function definitions.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission had a critical naming conflict:\n\n1. The code imported `create_optimizer` from `dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_fixed.py`\n2. It then redefined a local function also named `create_optimizer`\n3. Inside the redefined function, it called `create_optimizer(learning_rate)`\n4. This call resolved to the local function itself (not the imported one), causing infinite recursion\n\n**Error excerpt from logs:**\n```\nRecursionError: maximum recursion depth exceeded\n  File \"submission.py\", line 23, in create_optimizer\n    return create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  [Previous line repeated 994 more times]\n```\n\
    \n## Fix Applied\n**File:** `submissions/submission_v2.py`\n\n**Solution:** Renamed the imported function to avoid the name collision:\n\n```python\n# Original (broken):\nfrom dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_fixed import build_network, create_optimizer\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return create_optimizer(learning_rate)  # Calls itself!\n\n# Fixed:\nfrom dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_fixed import build_network, create_optimizer as create_optimizer_impl\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return create_optimizer_impl(learning_rate)  # Calls imported function\n```\n\nBy renaming the imported function to `create_optimizer_impl`, the local function can now properly delegate to the imported implementation without creating a recursive loop.\n\n## Verification\n- Monitor script confirmed the code ran for **300+ seconds without crashing**\n- Exit code: 0 (success)\n- The fix eliminated the recursion error completely\n- The evaluation system is\
    \ now processing the submission normally\n\n## Technical Details\n- **Bug Type:** Name shadowing / infinite recursion\n- **Severity:** Critical (immediate crash)\n- **Fix Complexity:** Simple (import alias)\n- **Version:** submission_v2.py\n- **Status:** Running successfully\n\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\nfrom dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_fixed import build_network, create_optimizer as create_optimizer_impl\n\nBASE_SEED = 7\nBATCH_SIZE = 64\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'd_model': 256,\n        'num_blocks': 5,\n        'dilations': [1,2,4,8,16],\n        'kernel_size': 7,\n        'motif_kernel_size': 5,\n        'dropout_rate': 0.10,\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return build_network(hparams.get('d_output',\
    \ 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return create_optimizer_impl(learning_rate)\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    ds = trial_data.get('dataset'); vm = trial_data.get('val_metric')\n    print(f\"[Complete] {ds} val_metric={vm}\")\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output\
    \ shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters:\
    \ from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 7 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|\
    \  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0118 |  0.4234  | 0.4405 \n 20  | 0.0083 |  0.4811  | 0.4997 \n 30  | 0.0046 |  0.4767  | 0.5076 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5076 Time:23s\n[Complete] CRI-On val_metric=0.5076022015131344\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.507602\nTraining time: 30s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0530  | 0.0530 \n 20  | 0.0004 |  0.0534  | 0.0545 \n 30  | 0.0004 |  0.0636  | 0.0738 \n 40  | 0.0004 |  0.0721  | 0.0756 \n=============================================\nEarly\
    \ stop at epoch 42 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0756 Time:139s\n[Complete] CRI-Off val_metric=0.0756378901454906\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.075638\nTraining time: 146s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1651 |  0.8860  | 0.8941 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8941 Time:783s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.8940570950508118\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.894057\nTraining time: 793s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric:\
    \ accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0582 |  0.8954  | 0.9323 \n 20  | 0.0341 |  0.9446  | 0.9462 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9462 Time:802s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9461538461538461\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.946154\nTraining time: 810s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0357 |  0.5383  | 0.5651\
    \ \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5651 Time:1038s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.5651080012321472\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.565108\nTraining time: 1047s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0678 |  0.9509  | 0.9509 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 12\n=============================================\nBest:0.9509 Time:1801s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9508881803091221\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950888\nTraining time: 1817s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\n\
    Task type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0128 |  0.8575  | 0.8575 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8575 Time:1824s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8574763536453247\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.857476\nTraining time: 1838s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 49b9e124-0fcf-429e-94f8-a3fca4427b8e\nTotal time: 1841s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 16:57:50,586\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761382670586777713\n2025-10-25 16:57:50,599\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761382670599529509\n\
    \n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `storage write noema/results/hybrid_dual_path_results.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max) — seed=123 — fixed kernel_dilation' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 633.\n- File created successfully: noema/results/hybrid_dual_path_results.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman\
    \ | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 633 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max) — seed=123 — fixed kernel_dilation | Noema II | 404 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 630 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max) — seed=7 — fixed kernel_dilation | Noema II | 403 | 0.6853 | 0.8575 | 0.0756 | 0.5076 | 0.8941 | 0.9509 | 0.5651 | 0.9462 |\n| 628 | 1 | Tri-expert gated: Pool(mean↔LSE τ=0.25) + BiGRU(160) + Motif(k=5) — scalar gate + post-LN — seed=42 | Noema II | 402 | 0.6850 | 0.8573 | 0.0841 | 0.4963 | 0.8974 | 0.9512 | 0.5644 | 0.9446 |\n| 625 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (DSConv mean+max + motif max) — seed=42 | Noema II | 401 | 0.6878 | 0.8559 | 0.0873 | 0.4992 | 0.8957 | 0.9518 | 0.5709 | 0.9538 |\n| 621 | 1 | Typed heads + optimizer tweak: clip=1.2 (AdamW) — seed=42 (retry) | Noema II | 399 | 0.6723 | 0.8592 | 0.0798 | 0.4685 | 0.8916 | 0.9507 | 0.5488 | 0.9077 |\n| 622 | 1 | Typed heads: SE reduction=6\
    \ (intermediate) on SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU — seed=42 | Noema II | 399 | 0.6748 | 0.8543 | 0.0752 | 0.5028 | 0.8957 | 0.9511 | 0.5555 | 0.8892 |\n| 618 | 1 | Typed heads: stronger SE reduction (reduction=8) on SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU — seed=42 | Noema II | 397 | 0.6753 | 0.8550 | 0.0816 | 0.5113 | 0.8944 | 0.9502 | 0.5543 | 0.8800 |\n| 617 | 1 | Typed heads: widen regression head (HH_reg=192) on SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU — seed=42 | Noema II | 397 | 0.6740 | 0.8614 | 0.0796 | 0.4923 | 0.8984 | 0.9497 | 0.5475 | 0.8892 |\n| 613 | 1 | Typed heads + optimizer tweak: AdamW β2=0.98, clip=0.8 — seed=42 | Noema II | 395 | 0.6745 | 0.8553 | 0.0820 | 0.5008 | 0.8896 | 0.9492 | 0.5596 | 0.8846 |\n| 612 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU + typed task heads (reg=160, cls=96–128) — seed=7 (tri-seed) | Noema II | 395 | 0.6755 | 0.8605 | 0.0760 | 0.5126 | 0.8918 | 0.9503 | 0.5496 | 0.8877 |\n| 608 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU + typed task heads\
    \ (reg=160, cls=96–128) — seed=123 | Noema II | 393 | 0.6757 | 0.8558 | 0.0787 | 0.5096 | 0.8979 | 0.9488 | 0.5527 | 0.8862 |\n| 607 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU + typed task heads (reg=160, cls=96–128) — seed=42 | Noema II | 393 | 0.6750 | 0.8519 | 0.0766 | 0.4949 | 0.8955 | 0.9499 | 0.5547 | 0.9015 |\n| 605 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + concat[mean,max,motif] + task-type heads — head_hidden=96 (seed=42) | Noema II | 391 | 0.6695 | 0.8551 | 0.0440 | 0.4445 | 0.8863 | 0.9490 | 0.5580 | 0.9492 |\n| 604 | 1 | SE-calibrated shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU + task-type heads (HH=128) — tri-seed (seed=7) | Noema II | 391 | 0.6758 | 0.8609 | 0.0796 | 0.4737 | 0.8963 | 0.9501 | 0.5610 | 0.9092 |\n| 602 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + concat[mean,max,motif] + task-type heads — seed=123 | Noema II | 389 | 0.6760 | 0.8575 | 0.0648 | 0.4666 | 0.8858 | 0.9507 | 0.5635 | 0.9431 |\n| 601 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + concat[mean,max,motif] + task-type heads — seed=42 | Noema II | 389 | 0.6767 | 0.8580\
