    \ 637 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max, k=7) — seed=42 — kernel sweep | Noema II | 405 | 0.6862 | 0.8552 | 0.0705 | 0.5076 | 0.8974 | 0.9510 | 0.5714 | 0.9508 |\n| 636 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max) — seed=123 — fixed alias | Noema II | 405 | 0.6777 | 0.8597 | 0.0397 | 0.4804 | 0.8969 | 0.9524 | 0.5625 | 0.9523 |\n| 633 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max) — seed=123 — fixed kernel_dilation | Noema II | 404 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 630 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max) — seed=7 — fixed kernel_dilation | Noema II | 403 | 0.6853 | 0.8575 | 0.0756 | 0.5076 | 0.8941 | 0.9509 | 0.5651 | 0.9462 |\n| 628 | 1 | Tri-expert gated: Pool(mean↔LSE τ=0.25) + BiGRU(160) + Motif(k=5) — scalar gate + post-LN — seed=42 | Noema II | 402 | 0.6850 | 0.8573 | 0.0841 | 0.4963 | 0.8974 | 0.9512 | 0.5644 | 0.9446 |\n| 625 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (DSConv mean+max + motif max) — seed=42 | Noema II | 401 | 0.6878 | 0.8559 | 0.0873 | 0.4992 | 0.8957 | 0.9518\
    \ | 0.5709 | 0.9538 |\n| 621 | 1 | Typed heads + optimizer tweak: clip=1.2 (AdamW) — seed=42 (retry) | Noema II | 399 | 0.6723 | 0.8592 | 0.0798 | 0.4685 | 0.8916 | 0.9507 | 0.5488 | 0.9077 |\n| 622 | 1 | Typed heads: SE reduction=6 (intermediate) on SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU — seed=42 | Noema II | 399 | 0.6748 | 0.8543 | 0.0752 | 0.5028 | 0.8957 | 0.9511 | 0.5555 | 0.8892 |\n| 618 | 1 | Typed heads: stronger SE reduction (reduction=8) on SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU — seed=42 | Noema II | 397 | 0.6753 | 0.8550 | 0.0816 | 0.5113 | 0.8944 | 0.9502 | 0.5543 | 0.8800 |\n| 617 | 1 | Typed heads: widen regression head (HH_reg=192) on SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU — seed=42 | Noema II | 397 | 0.6740 | 0.8614 | 0.0796 | 0.4923 | 0.8984 | 0.9497 | 0.5475 | 0.8892 |\n| 613 | 1 | Typed heads + optimizer tweak: AdamW β2=0.98, clip=0.8 — seed=42 | Noema II | 395 | 0.6745 | 0.8553 | 0.0820 | 0.5008 | 0.8896 | 0.9492 | 0.5596 | 0.8846 |\n| 612 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE\
    \ + BiGRU + typed task heads (reg=160, cls=96–128) — seed=7 (tri-seed) | Noema II | 395 | 0.6755 | 0.8605 | 0.0760 | 0.5126 | 0.8918 | 0.9503 | 0.5496 | 0.8877 |\n| 608 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU + typed task heads (reg=160, cls=96–128) — seed=123 | Noema II | 393 | 0.6757 | 0.8558 | 0.0787 | 0.5096 | 0.8979 | 0.9488 | 0.5527 | 0.8862 |\n| 607 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU + typed task heads (reg=160, cls=96–128) — seed=42 | Noema II | 393 | 0.6750 | 0.8519 | 0.0766 | 0.4949 | 0.8955 | 0.9499 | 0.5547 | 0.9015 |\n| 605 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + concat[mean,max,motif] + task-type heads — head_hidden=96 (seed=42) | Noema II | 391 | 0.6695 | 0.8551 | 0.0440 | 0.4445 | 0.8863 | 0.9490 | 0.5580 | 0.9492 |\n| 604 | 1 | SE-calibrated shared DSConv + mean↔LSE + BiGRU + task-type heads (HH=128) — tri-seed (seed=7) | Noema II | 391 | 0.6758 | 0.8609 | 0.0796 | 0.4737 | 0.8963 | 0.9501 | 0.5610 | 0.9092 |\n| 602 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + concat[mean,max,motif] + task-type\
    \ heads — seed=123 | Noema II | 389 | 0.6760 | 0.8575 | 0.0648 | 0.4666 | 0.8858 | 0.9507 | 0.5635 | 0.9431 |\n| 601 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + concat[mean,max,motif] + task-type heads — seed=42 | Noema II | 389 | 0.6767 | 0.8580 | 0.0525 | 0.4893 | 0.8844 | 0.9506 | 0.5641 | 0.9385 |\n| 596 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + mean+max pooling + BiGRU + Motif(k=5,max) + task-type heads — seed=42 | Noema II | 387 | 0.6659 | 0.8602 | 0.0815 | 0.4624 | 0.8995 | 0.9500 | 0.5603 | 0.8477 |\n| 597 | 1 | SE-shared DSConv + mean+max pooling + BiGRU + Motif(k=5,max) + task-type heads — seed=123 | Noema II | 387 | 0.6737 | 0.8539 | 0.0848 | 0.5068 | 0.8911 | 0.9503 | 0.5583 | 0.8708 |\n\nPage 1 of 32 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-32, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
