tick: 412
role: model
parts:
- text: "Preparing an adaptive fusion variant to reduce CRI-Off variance while 652/653 run. No new runs submitted now (respecting 2-job concurrency).\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noema/submissions/dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_gated.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Hybrid Dual-Path DSConv with learnable scalar gating between main-path and motif-path.\n  - Shared DSConv backbone (5 dilated DW+PW conv blocks, d_model=256), kernel_dilation fix\n  - Main path: configurable aggregator: 'mean_max' (concat mean, max) or 'mean_lse' (concat mean, LSE τ, len-norm)\n  - Motif path: Conv1D(k=motif_kernel_size) + GELU + Dropout -> global max\n  - Adaptive fusion: project each path to hidden_dim, learnable 2-way scalar gate (softmax over logits)\n  - Head: task-specific 128-d MLP + dropout\n  \"\"\"\n  from typing import Any, Dict, Sequence\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  from jax import random\n  from jax.scipy.special import logsumexp\n  import flax.linen as nn\n  import optax\n\
    \n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.001,\n          'd_model': 256,\n          'num_blocks': 5,\n          'dilations': [1, 2, 4, 8, 16],\n          'kernel_size': 7,\n          'motif_kernel_size': 5,\n          'dropout_rate': 0.10,\n          'aggregator': 'mean_max',   # or 'mean_lse'\n          'tau': 0.25,\n          'length_normalize_lse': True,\n      }\n\n  def _lse_pool(h, tau: float, length_normalize: bool = True):\n      L = h.shape[1]\n      core = logsumexp(h / tau, axis=1)\n      if length_normalize:\n          core = core - jnp.log(jnp.array(L, dtype=h.dtype))\n      return tau * core\n\n  class DSConvBlock(nn.Module):\n      d_model: int\n      kernel_size: int\n      dilation: int\n      dropout_rate: float\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          residual = x\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.d_model,\n                      kernel_size=(self.kernel_size,),\n\
    \                      feature_group_count=self.d_model,\n                      kernel_dilation=(self.dilation,),\n                      padding='SAME',\n                      name='dw')(x)\n          x = nn.gelu(x)\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.d_model, kernel_size=(1,), name='pw')(x)\n          x = nn.gelu(x)\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          return residual + x\n\n  class SharedBackbone(nn.Module):\n      d_model: int\n      kernel_size: int\n      dilations: Sequence[int]\n      dropout_rate: float\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          x = nn.Dense(self.d_model, name='in_proj')(x)\n          x = nn.gelu(x)\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          h = x\n          for i, d in enumerate(self.dilations):\n              h = DSConvBlock(self.d_model,\
    \ self.kernel_size, d, self.dropout_rate, name=f'dsconv_{i}')(h, deterministic)\n          return h\n\n  def _main_path_features(h, aggregator: str, tau: float, length_normalize_lse: bool):\n      mean_pooled = jnp.mean(h, axis=1)\n      if aggregator == 'mean_max':\n          max_pooled = jnp.max(h, axis=1)\n          return jnp.concatenate([mean_pooled, max_pooled], axis=-1)\n      elif aggregator == 'mean_lse':\n          lse_pooled = _lse_pool(h, tau, length_normalize_lse)\n          return jnp.concatenate([mean_pooled, lse_pooled], axis=-1)\n      else:\n          raise ValueError(f'Unknown aggregator: {aggregator}')\n\n  class RegressionHead(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int\n      hidden: int = 128\n      dropout_rate: float = 0.1\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          z = nn.Dense(self.hidden)(x); z = nn.gelu(z)\n          z = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(z, deterministic=deterministic)\n          z = nn.Dense(self.d_output)(z)\n\
    \          return z.squeeze(-1) if self.d_output == 1 else z\n\n  class MultiLabelRegressionHead(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int\n      hidden: int = 128\n      dropout_rate: float = 0.1\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          z = nn.Dense(self.hidden)(x); z = nn.gelu(z)\n          z = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(z, deterministic=deterministic)\n          return nn.Dense(self.d_output)(z)\n\n  class ClassificationHead(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int\n      hidden: int = 128\n      dropout_rate: float = 0.1\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          z = nn.Dense(self.hidden)(x); z = nn.gelu(z)\n          z = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(z, deterministic=deterministic)\n          return nn.Dense(self.d_output)(z)\n\n  class HybridDualPathGated(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int\n      task_type: str\n      d_model: int = 256\n      num_blocks: int = 5\n      dilations: Sequence[int]\
    \ = (1,2,4,8,16)\n      kernel_size: int = 7\n      motif_kernel_size: int = 5\n      dropout_rate: float = 0.10\n      aggregator: str = 'mean_max'\n      tau: float = 0.25\n      length_normalize_lse: bool = True\n\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          h = SharedBackbone(self.d_model, self.kernel_size, self.dilations, self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic)\n          # Paths\n          main_feat = _main_path_features(h, self.aggregator, self.tau, self.length_normalize_lse)\n          m = nn.Conv(features=self.d_model, kernel_size=(self.motif_kernel_size,), padding='SAME', name='motif_conv')(h)\n          m = nn.gelu(m)\n          m = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(m, deterministic=deterministic)\n          motif_feat = jnp.max(m, axis=1)\n          # Project to hidden_dim for balanced gating\n          main_proj = nn.Dense(self.d_model, name='main_proj')(main_feat)\n          motif_proj = nn.Dense(self.d_model, name='motif_proj')(motif_feat)\n\
    \          # Learnable scalar gate (2-way)\n          logits = self.param('fusion_logits', lambda rng, shp: jnp.zeros((2,), dtype=main_proj.dtype), (2,))\n          w = jax.nn.softmax(logits)\n          fused = w[0] * main_proj + w[1] * motif_proj\n          fused = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(fused, deterministic=deterministic)\n          fused = nn.LayerNorm(name='post_ln')(fused)\n          # Heads\n          if self.task_type == 'regression':\n              return RegressionHead(self.d_output, hidden=128, dropout_rate=self.dropout_rate)(fused, deterministic)\n          elif self.task_type == 'multilabel_regression':\n              return MultiLabelRegressionHead(self.d_output, hidden=128, dropout_rate=self.dropout_rate)(fused, deterministic)\n          elif self.task_type in ('multilabel_classification', 'multiclass_classification'):\n              return ClassificationHead(self.d_output, hidden=128, dropout_rate=self.dropout_rate)(fused, deterministic)\n          else:\n\
    \              raise ValueError(f'Unknown task_type: {self.task_type}')\n\n  class WrappedRNANetwork:\n      def __init__(self, d_output=1, task_type='regression', hparams: Dict[str, Any] = None):\n          hp = hparams or {}\n          self.net = HybridDualPathGated(\n              d_output=d_output,\n              task_type=task_type,\n              d_model=int(hp.get('d_model', 256)),\n              num_blocks=int(hp.get('num_blocks', 5)),\n              dilations=tuple(hp.get('dilations', [1,2,4,8,16])),\n              kernel_size=int(hp.get('kernel_size', 7)),\n              motif_kernel_size=int(hp.get('motif_kernel_size', 5)),\n              dropout_rate=float(hp.get('dropout_rate', 0.10)),\n              aggregator=str(hp.get('aggregator', 'mean_max')),\n              tau=float(hp.get('tau', 0.25)),\n              length_normalize_lse=bool(hp.get('length_normalize_lse', True)),\n          )\n      def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n          params_key, dropout_key = random.split(rng_key)\n\
    \          variables = self.net.init({'params': params_key, 'dropout': dropout_key}, dummy_input, deterministic=True)\n          return variables['params']\n      def apply(self, params, x, deterministic=True, rng_key=None):\n          if deterministic:\n              return self.net.apply({'params': params}, x, deterministic=True)\n          else:\n              if rng_key is None:\n                  rng_key = random.PRNGKey(0)\n              return self.net.apply({'params': params}, x, deterministic=False, rngs={'dropout': rng_key})\n\n  def build_network(d_output, task_type, hparams):\n      return WrappedRNANetwork(d_output=d_output, task_type=task_type, hparams=hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=0.01)\n      )\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noema/results/hybrid_dual_path_results.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n \
    \ # Hybrid Dual-Path — Adaptive fusion prepared (Tick 411)\n  SE reduced CRI-Off; mean+LSE main-path also degraded it. RegCal (seed=123) and k=3 motif (seed=42) are running (652, 653).\n  Prepared:\n  - dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_gated.py: adds learnable 2-way scalar gate between main and motif paths (with per-path projections) to adaptively weight motif contributions. Plan: submit after current jobs finish if RegCal/k=3 don't resolve CRI-Off variance.\n```"
