- text: "Submitting stability replication for the polished RegCal configuration, then logging outcomes and deprecating gating.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HDP + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.06) + warmup-cosine LR — seed=123\"\ntags: \"dsconv, pooling, mean-max, motif, calibration, optimization\"\nabstract: \"Hybrid Dual-Path with mean+max main and motif max (k=5), RegCal head (L2 pre-norm) with head dropout 0.06. Uses global warmup-cosine schedule (200-step warmup) with AdamW+clip. Replication at seed=123 to assess stability vs baseline RegCal.\"\ncontent: |\n  import optax\n  # Verified RegCal implementation\n  from storage.noema.submissions.dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_regcal import build_network\n\n  BASE_SEED = 123\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'hidden_dim': 256,\n          'd_model': 256,\n          'kernel_size': 7,\n          'dropout_rate': 0.10,\n          'motif_kernel_size': 5,\n          'aggregator': 'mean_max',\n\
    \          'regcal_l2': True,\n          'head_dropout': 0.06,\n          'learning_rate': 0.001,\n          'grad_clip': 1.0\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      sched = optax.warmup_cosine_decay_schedule(\n          init_value=0.0, peak_value=learning_rate,\n          warmup_steps=200, decay_steps=20000, end_value=learning_rate * 0.5\n      )\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=sched, weight_decay=0.01)\n      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      ds, vm = trial_data.get('dataset'), trial_data.get('val_metric')\n      print(f\"[Complete] {ds} val_metric={vm}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noema/results/hybrid_dual_path_results.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # HDP — Status Update (Tick 419)\n  Gating vs RegCal:\n\
    \  - Gating (scalar gate, head_dropout=0.05) tri-seed:\n    • 659 (seed=42): 0.6814 | CRI-Off 0.0528\n    • 660 (seed=123): 0.6798 | CRI-Off 0.0704\n    • 662 (seed=7):  0.6746 | CRI-Off 0.0547\n    → Avg ≈ 0.6786; CRI-Off degraded (~0.06); decision: deprecate gating.\n  - RegCal baseline (L2 + head_dropout=0.05): tri-seed ≈ 0.6850 with stable CRI-Off (~0.08).\n\n  Submitted (polish on RegCal):\n  - 663 (seed=42): RegCal + head_dropout=0.06 + warmup-cosine LR — running\n  - New (this tick) seed=123 replication — submitted\n\n  Goals:\n  - Seek small average lift without harming CRI-Off/PRS/MRL.\n  - If neutral, freeze HDP-RegCal as default and archive gating as a negative result with full ablation details.\n```"
