  \ the discussion and reproducibility**\n\nIn the discussion section, I need to interpret the effects and clarify why CRI-Off has stabilized since overcoming earlier instability from seed 123. \n\nFor the reproducibility checklist, I’ll include the location of the code file, version, hyperparameters, and seeds, along with the path to the implementing function. \n\nIn the limitations section, I'll point out that CRI-Off is sensitive and that there's a trade-off in classification accuracy. Finally, I’ll ensure to format the YAML block correctly, quoting special characters and possibly adding optional tags like \"rna, dsconv, pooling, calibration, reproducibility.\" Let’s keep everything succinct but thorough."
