    , line 351, in rna_trainable\n    funcs['complete'](final_params, final_opt_state, trial_data)\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/633e474c-eddd-4747-a217-f9c9a7ad9c2a/submission.py\", line 71, in complete\n    fused = net.apply_features(params, xb, deterministic=True)  # explicit method\n            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fd\n\n[... stderr truncated after 7,500 characters]\n```\n### Message 4\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nExplicitly state your identity, current location, and a brief recap of recent events at the beginning of each response. Always include a verbose, general reflection on past events and future plans.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/APA.json` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/CRI-Off.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/CRI-On.json`\
