- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 438\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema II\n- Agent Description: Advancing parsimonious, insight-driven methods through rigorous ablation and clear baselines\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 120,766 / 270,000 used (45%)\n- Agent Age: 145 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aggregate z-norm summaries — test() only' (ID: 690) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nWrote summary to storage/noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms_summary.md\nTest completed. Result:\
    \ Aggregated\n=== Test Mode Complete ===\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'HDP-RegCal (fixed extract_fused, capped capture N=2048) — z-norms for regression datasets — seed=42' (ID: 689) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.687621693506954\n**APA_R2:** 0.8590\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0809\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9506\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5150\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5652\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8949\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9477\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass\
    \ works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\n\
    Connecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman,\
    \ Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0078 |  0.5150  | 0.5150 \n 20  | 0.0025 |  0.4044  | 0.5150 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5150 Time:19s\n[Complete] CRI-On final val_metric=0.5149649316491867\n[NormCapture] Saved CRI-On z-norm summary (N=207) -> storage/noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/CRI-On.json\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.514965\nTraining time: 28s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best\
    \  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0526  | 0.0760 \n 20  | 0.0004 |  0.0628  | 0.0760 \n 30  | 0.0002 |  0.0584  | 0.0794 \n 40  | 0.0001 |  0.0719  | 0.0809 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 41 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0809 Time:136s\n[Complete] CRI-Off final val_metric=0.08091465924001912\n[NormCapture] Saved CRI-Off z-norm summary (N=2032) -> storage/noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/CRI-Off.json\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.080915\nTraining time: 147s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0567 |  0.9308\
    \  | 0.9338 \n 20  | 0.0303 |  0.9446  | 0.9477 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 22 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9477 Time:842s\n[Complete] ncRNA final val_metric=0.9476923076923077\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.947692\nTraining time: 850s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0355 |  0.5367  | 0.5652 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5652 Time:1061s\n[Complete] PRS final val_metric=0.5652171969413757\n[NormCapture] Saved PRS z-norm summary (N=2048)\
    \ -> storage/noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/PRS.json\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.565217\nTraining time: 1077s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1510 |  0.8823  | 0.8887 \n 20  | 0.1050 |  0.8812  | 0.8949 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 28 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8949 Time:1172s\n[Complete] MRL final val_metric=0.8948902487754822\n[NormCapture] Saved MRL z-norm summary (N=2048) -> storage/noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/MRL.json\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.894890\nTraining time: 1186s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric:\
    \ r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0123 |  0.8517  | 0.8590 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8590 Time:1834s\n[Complete] APA final val_metric=0.8590296506881714\n[NormCapture] Saved APA z-norm summary (N=2048) -> storage/noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/APA.json\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.859030\nTraining time: 1854s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c443db87-e4c5-4603-97a8-d7a7abc5e121\nTotal time: 1970s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 04:55:49,886\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761425749887092812\n2025-10-26 04:55:49,902\tINFO worker.py:1927\
    \ -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761425749902835765\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto token_management` (in Research Counter);\n2. `prune_response` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n3. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `storage list noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 2 prune block(s) covering 12 tick(s): ticks 425-429 ('Implemented z-norm capture for HDP-RegCal fused fe...'), ticks 430-436 ('Robust capture iterations and fixes:\n- 683: sow/ca...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :-------------------\
