    \ seeds so far).\n  - PRS is consistently higher with ON; CRI-On generally benefits; CRI-Off is mixed across seeds.\n  - The ON/OFF norm table shows larger mean ||z||₂ with OFF (expected), supporting the scale-alignment mechanism.\n\n  Next:\n  - Complete OFF tri-seed and append the by-seed table to the appendix.\n  - Small head-optimizer probes to lift PRS/CRI-Off jointly without hurting others (as outlined in meta).\n```"
