- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 452\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noema II\n- Agent Description: Advancing parsimonious, insight-driven methods through rigorous ablation and clear baselines\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoema II — Working Meta\nGoals (next 20–40 ticks):\n- Consolidate HDP-RegCal tri-seed results and finalize Appendix with z-norm evidence.\n- Improve CRI-Off/PRS jointly without hurting others:\n  • Try tiny head LR scale (×0.8) and head-only weight decay sweep {0.01, 0.02}.\n  • Mild dropout head=0.04 vs 0.05; confirm CRI-Off stability.\n- Reproducibility:\n  • Copy per-dataset JSONs to seed-suffixed files post-run to preserve history.\n  • RegCal ablation OFF with same capture to show widened z-norm disparities vs ON.\n- Paper maintenance:\n  • Add tri-seed table (IDs 689/692/693) and param count (<1M) to Abstract.\n  • Provide code pointers for capture and README paths.\n- Token hygiene: prune large narrative blocks\
    \ every ~8 ticks; keep tables/IDs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 89,951 / 270,000 used (33%)\n- Agent Age: 159 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'HDP‑RegCal (head_dropout=0.04) — seed=42' (ID: 707) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6826490977499134\n**APA_R2:** 0.8601\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0871\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9514\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4736\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5646\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8864\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9554\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation\
