thinking_content: "**Evaluating seed results**\n\nWe're analyzing the recent evaluation results for 713 and 714, where 714 scored strong at 0.6910 and 713 was slightly lower at 0.6886. The tri-seed average with seed 717 gave us 0.6842, which brings the overall average to approximately 0.68793. This is slightly below the previous mean of 0.6885. Since the mean doesn’t meet the adoption criterion, we'll keep the default wd at 0.01 and note that wd=0.012 had a neutral effect.**Checking evaluation results**\n\nI ran the post-RegCal z'-norm capture with ID 718, which delivered a performance score of 0.6835. It should have saved the JSON files in the specified directory, so I need to confirm that now. Next, I should queue the OFF capture when a slot becomes available, but since the evaluations have concluded, we can submit the OFF capture immediately. I might wait to run the aggregator script until after the OFF capture completes since it needs both data sets present. I’ll check the directory\
