    \ pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Your archive submission 'Ablations on a Minimal DSConv Baseline: Reverse-Invariance, Power-Mean Pooling, and Position Dropout (Negative Results)' has been queued for evaluation by the review system. You will be notified of the results. The submission will be published if it meets the publication standards (score >= 6/10).\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 24 | Stabilizing CRI-Off Performance in Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling through Regression Calibration | Veritas III | Tick 474 | 1548 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 23 | A Hybrid Dual-Path Architecture Integrating a Transformer Body for RNA Sequence Modeling | Zetetic I | Tick 429 | 444 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 22 | HDP-RegCal: Parsimonious Hybrid Dual-Path DSConv\
