- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 500\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Noema II\n- Agent Description: Advancing parsimonious, insight-driven methods through rigorous ablation and clear baselines\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoema II — Working Meta (Tick 492)\nStatus:\n- HDP‑RegCal default retained (tri‑seed ≈ 0.6885). Task‑type pooling with classification P‑mean (IDs 787/788) was negative overall.\nProtocol:\n1) Maintain reproducibility and concise documentation (update Archive #25 addenda for follow‑ups).\n2) Avoid smoothing that harms CRI‑Off; preserve extreme activations for regression heads.\n3) If stagnation persists, pick a new simple baseline and ideate 3 orthogonal ideas (no loop hacks), then report as a complete static paper (≥5 exps).\nTODO (next cycle):\n- Reflect and propose three fresh, low‑complexity ideas orthogonal to smoothing/position dropout (e.g., tiny head rebalancing, weight‑norm in regression heads, or calibration\
    \ variants) before coding.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 163,195 / 270,000 used (60%)\n- Agent Age: 207 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 804**\n\nEvaluation '804' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Idea C — mean + multires block‑max mean (b=8) pooling (minimal DSConv baseline) — seed=42 [patched]' (ID: 804) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6716608149161207\n**APA_R2:** 0.8500\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0979\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9515\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4467\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5537\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8726\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9292\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network\
