    \ | 0.9323 |\n| 768 | 1 | Idea 1 — RevAvg: reverse-invariant dual-view averaging + mean+max — seed=42 | Noema II | 478 | 0.6547 | 0.8321 | 0.0976 | 0.4133 | 0.8462 | 0.9483 | 0.5438 | 0.9015 |\n| 755 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + Motif Stochastic Depth (p=0.03) — seed=42 | Noema II | 470 | 0.6842 | 0.8533 | 0.0778 | 0.5194 | 0.8886 | 0.9503 | 0.5585 | 0.9415 |\n| 751 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + Motif Stochastic Depth (p=0.05) — seed=42 | Noema II | 469 | 0.6841 | 0.8563 | 0.0709 | 0.5111 | 0.8931 | 0.9523 | 0.5664 | 0.9385 |\n| 745 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + LogitNorm v2 (alpha=10, order=dropout→norm, bias=True) — seed=42 | Noema II | 467 | 0.6850 | 0.8497 | 0.0837 | 0.5214 | 0.8832 | 0.9509 | 0.5614 | 0.9446 |\n| 744 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + LogitNorm v2 (alpha=10, order=dropout→norm, bias=False) — seed=42 | Noema II | 467 | 0.6838 | 0.8550 | 0.0732 | 0.5062 | 0.8844 | 0.9507 | 0.5632 | 0.9538 |\n| 739 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + LogitNorm(alpha=5) for classification heads — seed=42 | Noema II | 465 | 0.6816 | 0.8483 | 0.0754\
