    \ head_dropout=0.05) — seed=7 | Noema II | 455 | 0.6842 | 0.8612 | 0.0739 | 0.4924 | 0.8870 | 0.9516 | 0.5698 | 0.9538 |\n| 714 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (wd=0.012, head_dropout=0.05) — seed=123 | Noema II | 453 | 0.6910 | 0.8557 | 0.0846 | 0.5252 | 0.8989 | 0.9514 | 0.5671 | 0.9538 |\n| 713 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (wd=0.012, head_dropout=0.05) — seed=42 | Noema II | 453 | 0.6886 | 0.8575 | 0.0717 | 0.5139 | 0.8974 | 0.9516 | 0.5695 | 0.9585 |\n| 708 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (head_dropout=0.04, wd=0.012) — seed=123 | Noema II | 450 | 0.6860 | 0.8574 | 0.0820 | 0.4943 | 0.8916 | 0.9508 | 0.5691 | 0.9569 |\n| 707 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (head_dropout=0.04) — seed=42 | Noema II | 450 | 0.6826 | 0.8601 | 0.0871 | 0.4736 | 0.8864 | 0.9514 | 0.5646 | 0.9554 |\n| 705 | 1 | Build ON vs OFF z-norm comparison (fixed glob) — test() only | Noema II | 449 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 702 | 1 | Snapshot OFF norms and build ON vs OFF comparison — test() only | Noema II | 447 | n.a. | None | None |\
    \ None | None | None | None | None |\n| 699 | 1 | HDP (mean+max + motif k=5) — RegCal OFF + z-norm capture — seed=7 | Noema II | 446 | 0.6857 | 0.8572 | 0.0735 | 0.5176 | 0.8923 | 0.9518 | 0.5569 | 0.9508 |\n| 698 | 1 | HDP (mean+max + motif k=5) — RegCal OFF + z-norm capture — seed=42 | Noema II | 445 | 0.6860 | 0.8624 | 0.0870 | 0.4896 | 0.8922 | 0.9512 | 0.5645 | 0.9554 |\n| 697 | 1 | Copy z-norm JSONs to seed-suffixed files (status=on) — test() only | Noema II | 445 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 693 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (fixed extract_fused, N=2048) — z-norms for regression datasets — seed=123 | Noema II | 441 | 0.6907 | 0.8615 | 0.0834 | 0.5252 | 0.8854 | 0.9507 | 0.5783 | 0.9508 |\n| 692 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (fixed extract_fused, N=2048) — z-norms for regression datasets — seed=7 | Noema II | 441 | 0.6871 | 0.8627 | 0.0848 | 0.4947 | 0.8919 | 0.9514 | 0.5722 | 0.9523 |\n| 690 | 1 | Aggregate z-norm summaries — test() only | Noema II | 437 | n.a. | None |\
    \ None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 689 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (fixed extract_fused, capped capture N=2048) — z-norms for regression datasets — seed=42 | Noema II | 436 | 0.6876 | 0.8590 | 0.0809 | 0.5150 | 0.8949 | 0.9506 | 0.5652 | 0.9477 |\n| 688 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (explicit fused extractor) — overwrite z-norms for regression datasets — seed=42 | Noema II | 434 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 683 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (default, patched) + direct fused-feature z-norm capture — seed=42 | Noema II | 430 | 0.6849 | 0.8586 | 0.0791 | 0.5001 | 0.8900 | 0.9503 | 0.5620 | 0.9538 |\n| 679 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (default) + Robust z-norm capture via system.load_dataset (APA, CRI-Off, CRI-On, MRL, ... | Noema II | 427 | 0.6841 | 0.8612 | 0.0743 | 0.4907 | 0.8937 | 0.9511 | 0.5606 | 0.9569 |\n| 677 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (default) + Post-training z-norm capture (APA, CRI-Off, CRI-On, MRL, PRS) — seed=42 | Noema II | 425 | 0.6858 | 0.8604 | 0.0829 | 0.5026 | 0.8872 | 0.9519 | 0.5646 | 0.9508 |\n| 669 | 1 |\
    \ HDP + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.05), motif k=7 — seed=42 | Noema II | 420 | 0.6834 | 0.8603 | 0.0955 | 0.4912 | 0.8920 | 0.9506 | 0.5586 | 0.9354 |\n| 666 | 1 | HDP + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.06) + warmup-cosine LR — seed=123 | Noema II | 419 | 0.6851 | 0.8592 | 0.0724 | 0.5098 | 0.8829 | 0.9515 | 0.5645 | 0.9554 |\n| 663 | 1 | HDP + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.06) + warmup-cosine LR — seed=42 | Noema II | 418 | 0.6833 | 0.8592 | 0.0711 | 0.4903 | 0.8922 | 0.9516 | 0.5667 | 0.9523 |\n| 662 | 1 | HDP + RegCal + learned scalar gate (main↔motif), k=5 — seed=7 | Noema II | 417 | 0.6746 | 0.8575 | 0.0547 | 0.4790 | 0.8919 | 0.9511 | 0.5646 | 0.9231 |\n| 660 | 1 | HDP + RegCal + learned scalar gate (main↔motif), k=5 — seed=123 | Noema II | 415 | 0.6798 | 0.8548 | 0.0704 | 0.4594 | 0.8983 | 0.9504 | 0.5666 | 0.9585 |\n| 659 | 1 | HDP + RegCal + learned scalar gate (main↔motif), k=5 — seed=42 | Noema II | 415 | 0.6814 | 0.8580 | 0.0528 | 0.4881 | 0.8976 | 0.9511 | 0.5701 | 0.9523 |\n| 658\
    \ | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max, k=5) + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.05) — seed=7 | Noema II | 413 | 0.6860 | 0.8585 | 0.0744 | 0.5009 | 0.8948 | 0.9521 | 0.5677 | 0.9538 |\n| 657 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max, k=5) + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.05) — seed=42 | Noema II | 413 | 0.6835 | 0.8582 | 0.0870 | 0.4790 | 0.8943 | 0.9506 | 0.5629 | 0.9523 |\n\nPage 1 of 17 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-17, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
