parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HDP‑RegCal head rebalancing only (reg=160, cls=96) — LayerNorm — seed=42\"\ntags: \"hdp-regcal, capacity, calibration, ablation\"\nabstract: \"Isolate capacity effect: increase regression head hidden to 160 and decrease classification to 96, keeping LayerNorm (no RMSNorm). Tests whether reallocating head capacity toward regression panels improves aggregate without harming classification.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n  from hdp_regcal_rmsnorm_rebalance import create_network as _create_net, create_optimizer as _create_opt\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n          \"hidden_dim\": 256,\n          \"kernel_size\": 7,\n          \"dropout_rate\": 0.10,\n          \"ds_dilations\": [1, 2, 4, 8, 16],\n          \"head_hidden_reg\": 160,   # rebalanced toward regression\n          \"head_hidden_cls\"\
    : 96,    # slightly reduced classification\n          \"head_dropout\": 0.05,\n          \"use_rmsnorm\": False,     # keep LayerNorm to isolate capacity effect\n          \"regcal_on\": True,\n          \"motif_k\": 5,\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return _create_net(hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return _create_opt(learning_rate)\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write noema/results/stagnation_protocol_II_results.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Stagnation Protocol — Cycle II (updates with HDP‑RegCal RMSNorm results, seed=42)\n\n  HDP‑RegCal baseline (tri‑seed ≈ 0.6885, seed‑42 ≈ 0.6886):\n  - 813 — RMSNorm pre‑head (no capacity change): 0.6838\n      • APA 0.8513 | CRI-Off 0.0875 | CRI-On 0.5046 | PRS 0.5574 | MRL 0.8850 | Modif 0.9502 | ncRNA 0.9508\n      • Neutral/negative vs baseline; CRI‑Off slightly below typical; small gains in CRI‑On/ncRNA.\n  - 814 — RMSNorm + head rebalancing (reg=160, cls=96): 0.6800\n      • APA 0.8516\
    \ | CRI-Off 0.0880 | CRI-On 0.4865 | PRS 0.5574 | MRL 0.8807 | Modif 0.9515 | ncRNA 0.9446\n      • Negative on average; rebalancing did not help.\n\n  Decision:\n  - RMSNorm does not pass adoption gate (≥0.689 avg). Head rebalancing also negative.\n  - Next queued: head rebalancing only with LayerNorm (isolate capacity effect) — submitted as 'HDP‑RegCal head rebalancing only (reg=160, cls=96) — LayerNorm — seed=42'.\n\n  Notes:\n  - Minimal DSConv idea 1 (learned per‑channel mean↔max + concat[max]) increased average to 0.6805 but failed CRI‑Off/PRS gates; will not port to HDP‑RegCal.\n  - If remaining ablation is negative, finalize Cycle II as negative results with insights (retain literal max; RMSNorm neutral; capacity shift ineffective). Consider CPE‑style positional components for Cycle III (see Archive #27, #28).\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{preview 28}"
