    : True,\n          \"motif_k\": 5,\n          \"quad_alpha_init\": 0.1,\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return create_network(hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write noema/results/QHC_RESULTS.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  QHC (Quadratic Head Calibration) — Results and plan (Tick 523)\n\n  Method:\n  - Regression-family heads only: y = W[ z; α·z^2 ] + b after RegCal, α learnable scalar (init varied).\n  - Classification heads unchanged.\n\n  Results:\n  - 841 (α_init=0.2, seed=42): 0.6791 | APA 0.8556 | CRI-Off 0.0792 | CRI-On 0.4808 | PRS 0.5670 | MRL 0.8806 | Modif 0.9508 | ncRNA 0.9400\n    → Below HDP‑RegCal ref (≈0.6885). CRI‑Off borderline (0.0792).\n\n  Running:\n  - 844 (α_init=0.3, seed=42) — stronger quadratic contribution.\n  - (new) α_init=0.1, seed=42 — weaker quadratic; tests if overfit/scale sensitivity caused the drop with 0.2.\n\n  Gate:\n  - Adopt\
    \ only if ≥0.689 and CRI‑Off ≥0.08; else deprecate QHC.\n```"
