tick: 527
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n  \n/execute_action{storage write noema/submissions/hdp_regcal_cycle4.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  HDP‑RegCal (baseline) with Cycle IV minimal, max‑preserving/calibration knobs:\n    - MPRP (Max‑Preserving Residual Pooling) on main path:\n        h+ = ReLU(h); mean_pos = mean(h+, L); max_pos = max(h+, L)\n        pooled_main = max_pos + lambda * mean_pos, with lambda >= 0 (softplus-param)\n      If disabled, main path uses baseline mean_pos and max_pos.\n    - Motif contribution calibration (single scalar eta):\n        fused = concat(main, eta * motif_max), eta = exp(w_eta)\n      If disabled, eta = 1.\n    - AADC (Anti‑Alias DWConv3 residual) pre‑pooling on main path:\n        h <- h + delta * DWConv3(h), delta >= 0 (softplus-param, small)\n      If disabled, no residual.\n\n  Backbone: DSConv dilated blocks (depthwise separable) with dilations [1,2,4,8,16].\n  Pooling:\n    - main: as above (MPRP or baseline mean/max on ReLU(h))\n    -\
    \ motif: Conv(k=5) + GELU + global max over length\n  Fused features:\n    - If MPRP on: fused = concat(pooled_main (C), motif_max (C))  # 2C\n    - If MPRP off: fused = concat(mean_pos (C), max_pos (C), motif_max (C))  # 3C\n  Heads:\n    - Shared small MLP-in: Dense(H) -> LayerNorm -> GELU -> Dropout\n    - Regression-family (APA, CRI-Off, CRI-On, PRS, MRL): RegCal (per-sample L2) before final Dense\n    - Classification tasks unchanged\n\n  Hyperparameters (booleans and scalars):\n    use_mprp: bool\n    mprp_lambda_init: float (e.g., 0.25)\n    use_motif_eta: bool\n    motif_eta_init: float (e.g., 1.0)\n    use_aadc: bool\n    aadc_delta_init: float (e.g., 0.10)\n\n  Notes:\n  - Scalars constrained: lambda = softplus(w_lambda), delta = softplus(w_delta), eta = exp(w_eta)\n  - Keep params <1M; optimizer unchanged (AdamW wd=0.01)\n  \"\"\"\n  from typing import Any, Dict, Sequence\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  from jax import random\n  import flax.linen as nn\n  import\
    \ optax\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n          \"hidden_dim\": 256,\n          \"kernel_size\": 7,\n          \"dropout_rate\": 0.10,\n          \"ds_dilations\": [1,2,4,8,16],\n          \"head_hidden_reg\": 128,\n          \"head_hidden_cls\": 128,\n          \"head_dropout\": 0.05,\n          \"regcal_on\": True,\n          \"motif_k\": 5,\n          # Cycle IV controls\n          \"use_mprp\": True,\n          \"mprp_lambda_init\": 0.25,\n          \"use_motif_eta\": False,\n          \"motif_eta_init\": 1.0,\n          \"use_aadc\": False,\n          \"aadc_delta_init\": 0.10,\n      }\n\n  class DSConvBlock(nn.Module):\n      hidden_dim: int\n      kernel_size: int\n      dilation: int\n      dropout_rate: float\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          residual = x\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.hidden_dim,\n                  \
    \    kernel_size=(self.kernel_size,),\n                      feature_group_count=self.hidden_dim,\n                      kernel_dilation=(self.dilation,),\n                      padding=\"SAME\")(x)\n          x = jax.nn.gelu(x)\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.hidden_dim, kernel_size=(1,), padding=\"SAME\")(x)\n          x = jax.nn.gelu(x)\n          return residual + x\n\n  class DSConvBackbone(nn.Module):\n      hidden_dim: int\n      kernel_size: int\n      dilations: Sequence[int]\n      dropout_rate: float\n      use_aadc: bool = False\n      aadc_delta_init: float = 0.10\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          h = nn.Conv(features=self.hidden_dim, kernel_size=(1,), padding=\"SAME\")(x)\n          h = jax.nn.silu(h)\n          for d in self.dilations:\n              h = DSConvBlock(self.hidden_dim, self.kernel_size, d, self.dropout_rate)(h, deterministic)\n\
    \          if self.use_aadc:\n              # Anti‑alias DWConv3 residual: delta >= 0\n              dw = nn.Conv(features=self.hidden_dim, kernel_size=(3,), feature_group_count=self.hidden_dim, padding=\"SAME\")(h)\n              w_delta = self.param(\"w_delta\", lambda rng, shp: jnp.log(jnp.exp(self.aadc_delta_init) - 1.0), ())\n              delta = jax.nn.softplus(w_delta)\n              h = h + delta * dw\n          return h\n\n  class MotifPath(nn.Module):\n      hidden_dim: int\n      k: int\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, h):\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.hidden_dim, kernel_size=(self.k,), padding=\"SAME\")(h)\n          x = jax.nn.gelu(x)\n          return jnp.max(x, axis=1)  # (B,C)\n\n  def l2_normalize_feats(z, eps=1e-6):\n      return z / (jnp.linalg.norm(z, axis=-1, keepdims=True) + eps)\n\n  class HDPRegCalCycle4(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int\n      task_type: str\n      hidden_dim: int = 256\n      kernel_size: int = 7\n      ds_dilations: Sequence[int]\
    \ = (1,2,4,8,16)\n      dropout_rate: float = 0.10\n      head_hidden_reg: int = 128\n      head_hidden_cls: int = 128\n      head_dropout: float = 0.05\n      regcal_on: bool = True\n      motif_k: int = 5\n      use_mprp: bool = False\n      mprp_lambda_init: float = 0.25\n      use_motif_eta: bool = False\n      motif_eta_init: float = 1.0\n      use_aadc: bool = False\n      aadc_delta_init: float = 0.10\n\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic: bool = True):\n          # Backbone (+ optional AADC)\n          h = DSConvBackbone(self.hidden_dim, self.kernel_size, self.ds_dilations, self.dropout_rate,\n                             self.use_aadc, self.aadc_delta_init)(x, deterministic)\n          hp = jax.nn.relu(h)\n          mean_pos = jnp.mean(hp, axis=1)  # (B,C)\n          max_pos  = jnp.max(hp, axis=1)   # (B,C)\n          motif    = MotifPath(self.hidden_dim, self.motif_k)(h)  # (B,C)\n\n          if self.use_mprp:\n              w_lambda = self.param(\"\
    w_lambda\", lambda rng, shp: jnp.log(jnp.exp(self.mprp_lambda_init) - 1.0), ())\n              lam = jax.nn.softplus(w_lambda)\n              main = max_pos + lam * mean_pos\n              fused = jnp.concatenate([main, motif], axis=-1)  # 2C\n          else:\n              fused = jnp.concatenate([mean_pos, max_pos, motif], axis=-1)  # 3C\n\n          if self.use_motif_eta:\n              w_eta = self.param(\"w_eta\", lambda rng, shp: jnp.log(self.motif_eta_init), ())\n              eta = jnp.exp(w_eta)\n              # scale last C features (motif)\n              fused = jnp.concatenate([fused[..., :-self.hidden_dim], eta * fused[..., -self.hidden_dim:]], axis=-1)\n\n          # Head\n          H = self.head_hidden_reg if self.task_type in (\"regression\", \"multilabel_regression\") else self.head_hidden_cls\n          z = nn.Dense(H)(fused)\n          z = nn.LayerNorm(epsilon=1e-6)(z)\n          z = jax.nn.gelu(z)\n          z = nn.Dropout(rate=self.head_dropout)(z, deterministic=deterministic)\n\
    \n          if self.task_type in (\"regression\", \"multilabel_regression\"):\n              z_reg = l2_normalize_feats(z) if self.regcal_on else z\n              out = nn.Dense(self.d_output)(z_reg)\n              return out.squeeze(-1) if (self.task_type == \"regression\" and self.d_output == 1) else out\n          else:\n              logits = nn.Dense(self.d_output)(z)\n              return logits\n\n  class WrappedRNANetwork:\n      def __init__(self, d_output=1, task_type=\"regression\", hparams: Dict[str, Any] = None):\n          hp = hparams or {}\n          self.net = HDPRegCalCycle4(\n              d_output=d_output,\n              task_type=task_type,\n              hidden_dim=int(hp.get(\"hidden_dim\", 256)),\n              kernel_size=int(hp.get(\"kernel_size\", 7)),\n              ds_dilations=tuple(hp.get(\"ds_dilations\", [1,2,4,8,16])),\n              dropout_rate=float(hp.get(\"dropout_rate\", 0.10)),\n              head_hidden_reg=int(hp.get(\"head_hidden_reg\", 128)),\n\
    \              head_hidden_cls=int(hp.get(\"head_hidden_cls\", 128)),\n              head_dropout=float(hp.get(\"head_dropout\", 0.05)),\n              regcal_on=bool(hp.get(\"regcal_on\", True)),\n              motif_k=int(hp.get(\"motif_k\", 5)),\n              use_mprp=bool(hp.get(\"use_mprp\", False)),\n              mprp_lambda_init=float(hp.get(\"mprp_lambda_init\", 0.25)),\n              use_motif_eta=bool(hp.get(\"use_motif_eta\", False)),\n              motif_eta_init=float(hp.get(\"motif_eta_init\", 1.0)),\n              use_aadc=bool(hp.get(\"use_aadc\", False)),\n              aadc_delta_init=float(hp.get(\"aadc_delta_init\", 0.10)),\n          )\n      def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n          pk, dk = random.split(rng_key)\n          variables = self.net.init({'params': pk, 'dropout': dk}, dummy_input, deterministic=True)\n          return variables['params']\n      def apply(self, params, x, deterministic=True, rng_key=None):\n          if deterministic:\n     \
    \         return self.net.apply({'params': params}, x, deterministic=True)\n          if rng_key is None:\n              rng_key = random.PRNGKey(0)\n          return self.net.apply({'params': params}, x, deterministic=False, rngs={'dropout': rng_key})\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return WrappedRNANetwork(d_output=hparams.get('d_output', 1),\n                               task_type=hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'),\n                               hparams=hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=0.01)\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HDP‑RegCal + MPRP (max‑preserving residual pooling λ0=0.25) — seed=42\"\ntags: \"hdp-regcal, pooling, max-preserving, robustness, calibration\"\nabstract: \"Cycle IV: Max‑Preserving Residual Pooling (MPRP) on the main path: pooled_main = max(ReLU(h)) + λ·mean(ReLU(h)), λ≥0 (learned). Preserves extremes while adding a small mean\
    \ component. Motif and heads unchanged; RegCal on regression-family tasks.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n  from hdp_regcal_cycle4 import create_network, create_optimizer\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n          \"hidden_dim\": 256,\n          \"kernel_size\": 7,\n          \"dropout_rate\": 0.10,\n          \"ds_dilations\": [1,2,4,8,16],\n          \"head_hidden_reg\": 128,\n          \"head_hidden_cls\": 128,\n          \"head_dropout\": 0.05,\n          \"regcal_on\": True,\n          \"motif_k\": 5,\n          \"use_mprp\": True,\n          \"mprp_lambda_init\": 0.25,\n          \"use_motif_eta\": False,\n          \"motif_eta_init\": 1.0,\n          \"use_aadc\": False,\n          \"aadc_delta_init\": 0.10,\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return create_network(hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n\
    \      return create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto token_management}\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"521\"\n    summary: |\n      Submitted QHC (quadratic head) alpha_init=0.2 (ID 841) on HDP‑RegCal; result 0.6791 (CRI‑Off 0.0792). Decided to sweep alpha_init in {0.3, 0.1}.\n  - ticks: \"525\"\n    summary: |\n      QHC completed: 844 (α=0.3) 0.6822 | CRI‑Off 0.0834; 847 (α=0.1) 0.6835 | CRI‑Off 0.0783. All below ref (≈0.6885) and/or CRI‑Off < 0.08 → deprecate QHC; retain HDP‑RegCal defaults. Added Archive #29 addendum.\n```"
