parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n  \n/execute_action{storage write noema/results/CYCLE_IV_PLAN.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Cycle IV — Max-preserving, calibration-centric probes (HDP‑RegCal, seed=42)\n\n  Goals\n  - Preserve literal max; add minimal calibration to main/motif paths.\n  - Gates: avg ≥ 0.689 and CRI-Off ≥ 0.08; no ≥0.01 drops on Modif/ncRNA; PRS not worse by ≥0.01.\n\n  Ideas\n  1) MPRP (Max-Preserving Residual Pooling, main):\n     pooled_main = max(ReLU(h)) + λ·mean(ReLU(h)), λ≥0 (learned; λ0∈{0.1,0.25,0.5}).\n     Status: 853 running (λ0=0.25).\n\n  2) Motif η calibration (single scalar):\n     fused = concat(mean_pos, max_pos, η·motif_max), η>0 (learned; η0=1.0).\n     Status: to submit as second slot.\n\n  3) AADC (Anti-Alias DWConv3 residual, main pre-pool):\n     h <- h + δ·DWConv3(h), δ≥0 (small; δ0=0.1). Then baseline mean/max pooling.\n     Status: queued after 853/η.\n\n  Reporting\n  - Log learned scalars and per-dataset deltas to results/CYCLE_IV_RESULTS.md.\n\
    ```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HDP‑RegCal + motif contribution calibration (η learnable; η0=1.0) — seed=42\"\ntags: \"hdp-regcal, motif, calibration, max-preserving\"\nabstract: \"Cycle IV: Learn a single global scalar η to calibrate motif path contribution: fused = concat(mean_pos, max_pos, η·motif_max). Preserves literal max and main pooling; tests whether motif magnitude calibration improves robustness (CRI‑Off/PRS) without harming aggregate.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n  from hdp_regcal_cycle4 import create_network, create_optimizer\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n          \"hidden_dim\": 256,\n          \"kernel_size\": 7,\n          \"dropout_rate\": 0.10,\n          \"ds_dilations\": [1,2,4,8,16],\n          \"head_hidden_reg\": 128,\n          \"head_hidden_cls\": 128,\n          \"head_dropout\": 0.05,\n     \
    \     \"regcal_on\": True,\n          \"motif_k\": 5,\n          # Cycle IV toggles\n          \"use_mprp\": False,           # keep baseline mean+max in main\n          \"mprp_lambda_init\": 0.25,\n          \"use_motif_eta\": True,       # enable motif calibration\n          \"motif_eta_init\": 1.0,\n          \"use_aadc\": False,\n          \"aadc_delta_init\": 0.10,\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return create_network(hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return create_optimizer(learning_rate)\n```"
