    2025-10-27 05:03:47,081\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761512627081735735\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write noema/results/CYCLE_IV_RESULTS.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: noema/results/CYCLE_IV_RESULTS.md\n- Evaluation 'HDP‑RegCal + AADC (anti‑alias DWConv3 residual δ0=0.10 on main path) — seed=42' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 856.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 856 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + AADC (anti‑alias DWConv3\
