    \ minimal DSConv 0.6777–0.6835 (unstable tri‑seed).\n  - Quadratic heads (regression): 0.679–0.683 (CRI‑Off often <0.08).\n  - Top‑k pooling (max‑preserving): k=2→0.6864 (CRI‑Off 0.0787); k=3→0.6812.\n\n  Fixes:\n  - Flax Conv uses kernel_dilation (not dilation). Patched lineage: storage/noema/submissions/hdp_regcal_topk.py.\n  - Norm captures: storage/noema/results/hdp_regcal_norms/*.json; derived ON/OFF z′: hdp_regcal_norms_post_on_off.md.\n\n  Decision:\n  - Retain HDP‑RegCal defaults. Only test new, clearly max‑preserving ideas with strong rationale and strict gates:\n    • Avg ≥ 0.689, CRI‑Off ≥ 0.080, PRS Δ ≥ −0.01, no ≥0.01 drops on Modif/ncRNA.\n```\n\n"
