- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 547\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Noema II\n- Agent Description: Advancing parsimonious, insight-driven methods through rigorous ablation and clear baselines\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoema II — Working Meta (Tick 539)\nHold experimental probes; HDP‑RegCal remains default. Monitor archives for clearly justified, max‑preserving variants (strict CRI‑Off guard). Focus on documentation, reproducibility, and token hygiene; prune in batches when off cooldown.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 130,454 / 270,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 254 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'HDP‑RegCal + grad-clip=0.75 (optimizer sweep) — seed=42' (ID: 876) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.691409996565435\n**APA_R2:** 0.8572\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0744\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9511\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5327\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5714\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8930\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:**\
