tick: 547
role: model
parts:
- text: "Promising result: clip=0.50 meets gates (avg 0.6901, CRI-Off 0.0909). clip=0.75 scores higher (0.6914) but fails CRI-Off guard (0.0744). Proceeding to tri-seed clip=0.50.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HDP‑RegCal + grad-clip=0.50 — tri-seed (seed=7)\"\ntags: \"regcal, optimization, gradient-clipping, calibration\"\nabstract: \"Tri-seed replication for HDP‑RegCal with global-norm gradient clipping=0.50. Baseline seed=42 showed avg 0.6901 with CRI-Off 0.0909. Tests stability.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n  from dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_regcal import build_network as build_network\n\n  BASE_SEED = 7\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n          \"hidden_dim\": 256,\n          \"kernel_size\": 7,\n          \"dropout_rate\": 0.10,\n          \"ds_dilations\": [1,2,4,8,16],\n          \"motif_k\": 5,\n          \"head_hidden\": 128,\n\
    \          \"head_dropout\": 0.05,\n          \"regcal_on\": True\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return build_network(hparams.get(\"d_output\", 1), hparams.get(\"task_type\", \"regression\"), hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(0.50),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=0.01)\n      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      print(f\"[Complete] {trial_data.get('dataset')} val_metric={trial_data.get('val_metric')}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HDP‑RegCal + grad-clip=0.50 — tri-seed (seed=123)\"\ntags: \"regcal, optimization, gradient-clipping, calibration\"\nabstract: \"Tri-seed replication for HDP‑RegCal with global-norm gradient clipping=0.50. Baseline seed=42 gave avg 0.6901 with CRI-Off 0.0909; this run uses seed=123.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n\
    \  from dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_regcal import build_network as build_network\n\n  BASE_SEED = 123\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n          \"hidden_dim\": 256,\n          \"kernel_size\": 7,\n          \"dropout_rate\": 0.10,\n          \"ds_dilations\": [1,2,4,8,16],\n          \"motif_k\": 5,\n          \"head_hidden\": 128,\n          \"head_dropout\": 0.05,\n          \"regcal_on\": True\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return build_network(hparams.get(\"d_output\", 1), hparams.get(\"task_type\", \"regression\"), hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(0.50),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=0.01)\n      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      print(f\"[Complete] {trial_data.get('dataset')} val_metric={trial_data.get('val_metric')}\")\n```\n\n\
    `/execute_action{storage write noema/results/gradclip_ablation_results.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # HDP‑RegCal — Gradient Clipping Ablation Results (Tick 547)\n\n  Single-seed (42):\n  - clip=0.75 → 0.6914 | APA 0.8572 | CRI-Off 0.0744 | CRI-On 0.5327 | PRS 0.5714 | MRL 0.8930 | Modif 0.9511 | ncRNA 0.9600\n    • Note: Fails CRI-Off guard (≥0.080) despite highest avg.\n  - clip=0.50 → 0.6901 | APA 0.8593 | CRI-Off 0.0909 | CRI-On 0.5137 | PRS 0.5685 | MRL 0.8945 | Modif 0.9512 | ncRNA 0.9523\n    • Passes gates: avg ≥0.689 and CRI-Off ≥0.080; PRS within −0.01 of ref (~0.569–0.570).\n\n  Actions:\n  - Tri-seed clip=0.50 submitted (seeds 7, 123). If tri-seed mean ≥0.689 with CRI-Off ≥0.080, adopt clip=0.50 as new default optimizer setting for HDP‑RegCal.\n  - clip=0.75 not adopted due to CRI-Off <0.080.\n\n  Notes:\n  - RegCal kept ON; architecture unchanged; optimizer = AdamW (wd=0.01) with global-norm clipping.\n  - Next (if adopted): update FINAL.md, Archive #22 addendum, and index\
    \ files.\n```"
