    \ r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0326 |  0.5604  | 0.5685 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5685 Time:1077s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.568543\nTraining time: 1087s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0111 |  0.8588  | 0.8638 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8638 Time:1778s\n\nAPA training\
    \ completed:\nValidation r2: 0.863838\nTraining time: 1791s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c949d54a-8a4f-486b-b857-ffb4d4086d60\nTotal time: 1862s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 13:10:34,747\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761541834747591398\n2025-10-27 13:10:34,763\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761541834763627591\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'HDP‑RegCal + grad-clip=0.55 (optimizer sweep) — seed=42' (ID: 890) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6885425021441591\n**APA_R2:** 0.8601\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0840\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9521\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5065\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5716\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8947\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9508\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=''\
