- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"HDP‑RegCal + AdamW wd=0.0095 (grad-clip=0.50) — seed=42\"\ntags: \"hdp-regcal, optimizer, weight-decay, adamw, grad-clip\"\nabstract: \"Decoupled weight-decay sweep around the adopted default. Reduce AdamW weight_decay from 0.01 to 0.0095 with global-norm clipping=0.50; architecture unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n  from dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_regcal import build_network\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n          \"weight_decay\": 0.0095,\n          \"grad_clip\": 0.50,\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001, weight_decay: float = 0.0095):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(0.50),\n\
    \          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=weight_decay)\n      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      ds = trial_data.get('dataset'); vm = trial_data.get('val_metric')\n      print(f\"[Complete] {ds} val_metric={vm}\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write noema/results/optimizer_clip_wd_sweep.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Optimizer Sweep — Gradient Clip and Weight Decay (Tick 560)\n\n  Setup: HDP‑RegCal defaults; single seed=42 unless noted.\n\n  Results:\n  - Clip=0.45 (ID 889): 0.6872 | APA 0.8600 | CRI‑Off 0.0860 | CRI‑On 0.4959 | PRS 0.5638 | MRL 0.8980 | Modif 0.9513 | ncRNA 0.9554\n  - Clip=0.55 (ID 890): 0.6885 | APA 0.8601 | CRI‑Off 0.0840 | CRI‑On 0.5065 | PRS 0.5716 | MRL 0.8947 | Modif 0.9521 | ncRNA 0.9508\n  - (Running) wd=0.0095 @ clip=0.50 (this submission)\n\n  Interpretation:\n  - Clip=0.45: average down vs. default (0.6901 ref); no adoption.\n  - Clip=0.55: boosts PRS to 0.5716 but aggregate still 0.6885 (<0.689 guard); CRI‑Off\
    \ 0.0840 passes guard but no tri‑seed.\n  - Proceeding with a small weight-decay reduction (0.0095) at clip=0.50 to test if it recovers slight average while preserving guards.\n\n  Guardrails for adoption:\n  - Aggregate ≥ 0.689; CRI‑Off ≥ 0.080; PRS Δ ≥ −0.01; no ≥ 0.01 drops on Modif/ncRNA.\n\n  Next:\n  - If wd=0.0095 meets guardrails, tri‑seed; else log negative and retain clip=0.50, wd=0.01 default.\n```\n\n/execute_action{page_size 10}"
